#. module: hotel_website
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_hotel_website
msgid ""
".. image:: https://odoo-community.org/readme-banner-image\n"
"   :target: https://odoo-community.org/get-involved?utm_source=readme\n"
"   :alt: Odoo Community Association\n"
"\n"
"=====================\n"
"Hotel Website Booking\n"
"=====================\n"
"\n"
".. \n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! source digest: sha256:5139a9216eae2d008326e5a950b81de31c17593a2ea549f9e7159772001a9452\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-OCA%2Fvertical--hotel-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/OCA/vertical-hotel/tree/20.0/hotel_website\n"
"    :alt: OCA/vertical-hotel\n"
".. |badge4| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/weblate-Translate%20me-F47D42.png\n"
"    :target: https://translation.odoo-community.org/projects/vertical-hotel-20-0/vertical-hotel-20-0-hotel_website\n"
"    :alt: Translate me on Weblate\n"
".. |badge5| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/runboat-Try%20me-875A7B.png\n"
"    :target: https://runboat.odoo-community.org/builds?repo=OCA/vertical-hotel&target_branch=20.0\n"
"    :alt: Try me on Runboat\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"A guest-facing hotel website for the vertical-hotel modules. Guests\n"
"browse room types, check what is free for their dates and send a\n"
"reservation request; the front desk confirms it, and a free room of the\n"
"requested type is assigned at that moment.\n"
"\n"
"It is a request form, not a booking engine: a request holds no room\n"
"until the front desk confirms it, and the pages and the acknowledgement\n"
"say so. Requests nobody confirms are cancelled after a few days (see\n"
"*Configuration*).\n"
"\n"
"What guests see:\n"
"\n"
"- On the websites with the hotel layout: a homepage with the hotel's\n"
"  name (always the company's name), a booking bar and the room types;\n"
"  the company's name as header brand, page title and copyright. Other\n"
"  websites of the database keep their own look; the booking pages work\n"
"  on all of them, in the website theme's fonts.\n"
"- **Rooms & Suites** (``/rooms``): every room type with photos,\n"
"  description, capacity, amenities and \"from\" price. With dates, each\n"
"  type shows how many rooms are still free and can be added to the stay.\n"
"- A page per room type with gallery, facts, availability and reviews.\n"
"  Guests who stayed in a room type (confirmed reservation or folio) can\n"
"  review it once; reviews show after the hotel publishes them.\n"
"- A stay summary, a guest details form with the accompanying guests, and\n"
"  a \"request received\" page.\n"
"- Their requests and reservations in the portal (``/my/reservations``).\n"
"\n"
"How a website request becomes a reservation:\n"
"\n"
"1. The request is saved as a **draft** reservation, marked *Booked\n"
"   Online*, with one line per requested room carrying only its room\n"
"   type, and the accompanying guests on its *Guests* tab (each one a\n"
"   contact under the guest who booked). No room is blocked yet.\n"
"2. The guest gets an acknowledgement from the reservation's chatter. The\n"
"   form is protected by the website's captcha (reCAPTCHA or Cloudflare\n"
"   Turnstile, when set up), and one visitor can only send a few requests\n"
"   (5 a day per address, 3 open requests per e-mail).\n"
"3. The receptionist presses **Confirm**: each line without a room gets a\n"
"   free room of its type (cheapest first), then the usual confirmation\n"
"   runs (overlap check, room blocking, capacity check).\n"
"4. From there it is the normal flow: confirmation email, folio,\n"
"   check-in, invoice.\n"
"\n"
"Availability follows the back office rule (confirmed reservations and\n"
"folios block a room). Only rooms marked *Bookable on Website* are\n"
"offered.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"- **Room type form > Website**: photo, description, display order,\n"
"  reviews.\n"
"- **Room form > Website**: include or exclude a room from online\n"
"  bookings (*Bookable on Website*).\n"
"- **Website > Configuration > Settings > Online booking times**:\n"
"  check-in and check-out times given to website requests (default 14:00\n"
"  and 11:00).\n"
"- The website menu gets *Rooms* and *Gallery*; the portal home page gets\n"
"  a *Hotel Reservations* card.\n"
"- **Website > Configuration > Settings > Hotel Website Layout**: the\n"
"  hotel homepage, and the company's name as brand, page title and\n"
"  copyright, on that website. Set on the first website at installation.\n"
"- **Website > Configuration > Settings > Online request expiry**: days a\n"
"  website request waits for the front desk before it is cancelled\n"
"  (default 3; 0 cancels it only once the arrival date has passed). The\n"
"  guest is told. A daily scheduled action does it.\n"
"- **Website > Configuration > Settings > reCAPTCHA / Cloudflare\n"
"  Turnstile**: set one up to protect the request form from bots.\n"
"- **Room type form > Website > Reviews**: publish the reviews guests\n"
"  sent.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/vertical-hotel/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/vertical-hotel/issues/new?body=module:%20hotel_website%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Authors\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* Serpent Consulting Services Pvt. Ltd.\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"- Serpent Consulting Services Pvt. Ltd. <https://www.serpentcs.com>\n"
"\n"
"Other credits\n"
"-------------\n"
"\n"
"The sample photos of the website pages (``static/src/image``) are free\n"
"stock photos, under the Unsplash and Pexels licences, which allow using\n"
"and redistributing them. Replace them with the hotel's own photos\n"
"(website builder, room type and room forms).\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
"This module is maintained by the OCA.\n"
"\n"
".. image:: https://odoo-community.org/logo.png\n"
"   :alt: Odoo Community Association\n"
"   :target: https://odoo-community.org\n"
"\n"
