"promote its widespread use.\n"
"\n"
"This module is part of the `OCA/vertical-hotel <https://github.com/OCA/vertical-hotel/tree/20.0/hotel_website>`_ project on GitHub.\n"
"\n"
"You are welcome to contribute. To learn how please visit https://odoo-community.org/page/Contribute.\n"
msgstr ""

